/**
 * UniMorph schema validation.
 *
 * FEATURES is the union of the two published UniMorph feature lists:
 *   unimorph/unimorph.github.io  unimorph-schema-json/dimensions-to-features.json
 *   unimorph/um-canonicalize     um_canonicalize/tags.yaml (argument marking with the ARG prefix)
 * Generated by MorphoLens; do not edit by hand. Composite codes (IN+ABL, NOM/ACC) are
 * split into atoms before checking.
 *
 * An atom missing from both lists is classified per dataset:
 *   convention  used systematically (at least CONVENTION_MIN records), e.g. Turkish INFR, LOC,
 *               Evenki PSSRS/PSSRP: a documented deviation, kept in all analyses;
 *   anomaly     rare and matching no schema template, e.g. Chukchi ARBAB3S: likely an
 *               annotation or typographical error; stored verbatim, flagged, and excluded from
 *               the experiment.
 *
 * Self-contained (no imports) so scripts can load it with Node's type stripping.
 */

